              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 20:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wutmere jobedo kanyacel, aka acel kwoŋ jo otho m'ongoye gi wode, dhako pa jatho kiripi nywomirok woko ma peco gi jakicar. Omin cwore lanywomo go to timo rigo paka omin cwore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyathi makayo ma dhako no onywol ilacwoko nyingi jatho, ŋey nyingi go wokiri worere i Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.7+RUT.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ruth 4:7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka jacwo no k'omaro nywomo ciliendi omin, kenyo citho lakidho bongi jodongo i waŋkac to waco ni, “Omin cworan odak tiŋo malo nyingi omin i Isiraili, go kilatimo ran paka yworan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo jodongo ma tindi pere jolalwoŋo go luwo gi go. To ka go ocwire waco ni, “Angoye gi mito ma nywomo go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo ciliendi omin lakadho ruwaŋ jodongo, to fudho war i tiendi ywore, woŋul law i waŋe, to waco ni, “Me a gim'itimo ri jacwo ma kigeti peco p'omin go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilalwoŋo nyinge i Isiraili je nike peco pa ŋat'oluny war pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
